Good news, **you don’t need to search for or ask anyone for a coupon code** on Beat22! If a seller has added a coupon to their beat, the system will **automatically apply it** at checkout. No manual entry. No extra steps. **Here’s How It Works:**

1.  **Pick a Beat** Browse and choose any beat you like on [Beat22.com](https://beat22.com).
    
    ![Pick a Beat Browse and choose any beat you like on Beat22.com.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-07-162456.png)
    
2.  **Select a License Type** Click on the price next to WAV, WAV + Stems, or Exclusive to add the beat to your cart.
    
    ![Select a License Type Click on the price next to WAV, WAV + Stems, or Exclusive to add the beat to your cart.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-07-162507.png)
    
3.  **Open Your Cart** Click the cart icon at the top-right of the site to view your order.
    
    ![Open Your Cart Click the cart icon at the top-right of the site to view your order.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-07-162518.png)
    
4.  **Coupon Auto-Applies** If the seller has a coupon on that beat, the discount will **automatically reflect** in your cart.
    
    ![Coupon Auto-Applies If the seller has a coupon on that beat, the discount will automatically reflect in your](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-07-162529.png)
    
5.  **Complete Payment** Just proceed to payment with the discounted total.
    
    ![Complete Payment Just proceed to payment with the discounted total.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-07-162540.png)
    

**Important:**

-   You **do not need to enter any code manually**.
-   If a beat has a coupon, it will apply **automatically**.
-   You **don’t need to ask** anyone for a code. If it’s available, you’ll see the discount right away.

Now you can focus on making music and saving smart. Need help? Reach us anytime at **support@beat22.com**
